Attribution and provenance
==========================

This project is a derivative work. It was rebuilt from
transcriptionstream/phomymo (https://github.com/transcriptionstream/phomymo),
whose README states an MIT License but which ships no LICENSE file.

The upstream project established the hard parts that this rewrite builds on:
the Phomemo print protocols, the raster and dithering pipeline, and the
printer definitions. See the "Credits and provenance" section of README.md for
a file-level breakdown of what was ported and what is new.

Protocol research in the original project draws on:

- vivier/phomemo-tools — CUPS driver with reverse-engineered protocol
- yaddran/thermal-print — printer status query commands
- ooki1jp — M04AS/M04S protocol reverse-engineering

The MIT licence in LICENSE applies to this project. The upstream project's
own licence terms are its author's to state; this notice exists so the
provenance is unambiguous either way.
